.github/actions/example/action.yml:5:10: "runs.using" of this action is "node20", but Node.js 20 was removed from GitHub Actions on 2026-09-23, so the runner runs the action on Node.js 24 instead of the runtime it declares. declare "node24" and test the action on Node.js 24 (GitHub Enterprise Server and old self-hosted runners may still need the old name) [deprecated-node-runtime]
